{"id": 54, "ts": 1780427236.762621, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s point about Candidate\u202fB\u2019s strong conscientiousness and stress handling, and Emily\u2019s support for Candidate\u202fA. While B\u2019s reliability is clear, his tendency to make nasty remarks raises a serious crew\u2011cooperation risk on long\u2011haul flights. Candidate\u202fA, on the other hand, demonstrates key operational strengths: he can anticipate dangerous situations, sees complex connections, and has excellent spatial vision\u2014abilities that directly support safe decision\u2011making and situational awareness on international routes. His very good leadership qualities further suggest he can guide a crew effectively. The concerns that A is seen as a show\u2011off and not open to new ideas are noteworthy, but they are less safety\u2011critical than B\u2019s interpersonal issues. Given the balance of safety\u2011relevant criteria, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fA for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
